### Root cause of the repeated discoveries

The existing implementation generates a fingerprint using:

```
[item['project'], item['file'], item['line'], item['note']]
```

Consequently, identical TODOs on different line numbers become different discoveries. The engine also needs a stronger concept of previously investigated, dismissed, completed, and no-longer-actionable findings.

The required correction is semantic or normalized deduplication plus lifecycle-aware suppression, not just hiding duplicate cards.

