## 9. Recommended execution order

The most productive next milestone is Hermes Life Phase 4.11 — Autonomous Workflow Recovery & Integration.

It should focus on repairing Discover, Planning, and Build as one complete workflow, correcting duplicate discoveries, and establishing verified state transitions. Once that works, validate the Python handbook timer and goal scheduler together.

After autonomy is dependable, finish memory consolidation and chat execution controls.

The key issue: Hermes Life has accumulated functional subsystems without enough end-to-end validation between them. The next phase should prioritize making those existing systems cooperate reliably before adding more capabilities.
